                                                                                                         cs_ReportConfig_reportConfigEUTRA_eventA3(0, false, 0, ms0, rsrp, sameAsTriggerQuantity, 1, ms1024, r1)), //@sic R5s100187, Change 2: Set the a3-Offset for both events to 0 sic@
                                                                    omit,
